{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212580","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212580","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121258001:0":{"text":"아이 참... 정신이 하나도 없네. 대체 어디로 가야 하는 거야?","source_cn":"哎呀……真是昏了头了，到底该往哪边走啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38701545AC4495A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121258002:0":{"text":"신경 쓰이는 길이 하나 있어. 그 길 앞쪽에 무언가가 숨겨져 있는 것 같아.","source_cn":"有一条路，让我很在意。我觉得那条路的前方，似乎隐藏着什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE2EB81534E33588","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121258003:0":{"text":"네게 특별한 감지 능력이 있으니, 우리는 네 직감을 믿고 따라갈 거야.","source_cn":"既然你有特殊的感知能力，我们应该相信你的直觉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE327D16D6689E2B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121258004:0":{"text":"알파 일레븐, 어떤 길이 맞는 것 같아?","source_cn":"阿尔法十一，你认为哪条路才是正确的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x829B4DE159DF5C8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121258005:0":{"text":"북서쪽으로 가는 저 길.","source_cn":"西北方的那一条。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x631D47987A2887D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121258006:0":{"text":"좋아, 그럼 북서쪽으로 가자.","source_cn":"好，我们往那个方向走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59303FA9AF416F73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蕾米雅":{"text":"레미아","source":"蕾米雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔法十一":{"text":"알파 일레븐","source":"阿尔法十一","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}